## Provider Configuration in Settings

### Settings Location

Provider configuration lives in Cursor's user settings:

```json
{
  // Windows
  // %APPDATA%/Cursor/User/settings.json
  
  // macOS
  // ~/Library/Application Support/Cursor/User/settings.json
  
  // Linux
  // ~/.config/Cursor/User/settings.json
}
```

### Example Configuration

```json
{
  // Chat mode uses Anthropic
  "cursor.agent.chatModel": "claude-sonnet-4-20250514",
  "cursor.agent.chatProvider": "anthropic",
  
  // Agent mode uses OpenAI
  "cursor.agent.agentModel": "gpt-4-turbo",
  "cursor.agent.agentProvider": "openai",
  
  // Tab mode uses local Ollama
  "cursor.agent.tabModel": "codellama:7b",
  "cursor.agent.tabProvider": "custom",
  "cursor.agent.tabBaseUrl": "http://localhost:11434/v1"
}
```

