## Model Listing (SDK Reference)

When programmatically querying available models:

```typescript
// TypeScript
import { Cursor } from "@cursor/sdk";
const models = await Cursor.models.list({ apiKey: process.env.CURSOR_API_KEY! });
```

```python
# Python
from cursor_sdk import Cursor
models = Cursor.models.list()  # uses CURSOR_API_KEY from environment
```

The `list()` call returns:
- Valid model IDs for the account
- Per-model parameter definitions (reasoning effort, max mode)
- Preset variants available to the calling account

