## Troubleshooting

### Provider Not Responding

| Cause | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| API key expired | Regenerate and update in Cursor Settings |
| Rate limit exceeded | Switch to a different model or wait for quota reset |
| Network connectivity | Check proxy/firewall settings for API endpoint access |
| Custom endpoint down | Verify the server is running and reachable |
| Model ID changed | Check provider's current model list |

### Model Selection Not Taking Effect

| Cause | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| Settings not saved | Verify JSON syntax is valid; save and reload |
| Stale agent session | Restart the agent or reopen the Composer |
| Cloud vs local mismatch | Ensure the model is available on the selected runtime |
| Permission denied | Verify the API key has access to the selected model |

